ith your sticks to the music.\n\u2022 Match the Color: Slash notes that match your stick's color.\n\u2022 Match the Direction: Slash in the direction of the arrows.\n\u2022 Slash Freely: Slash ball-shaped notes freely in any direction.\n\u2022 Dodge: Avoid bombs and avoid hitting your head on walls.\n\n[Caution]\n\u2022 Not intended for children under the age of 13.\n\u2022 Ensure you have enough play space.\n\u2022 If you are sensitive to flashing lights or have a history of seizures, consult a doctor first.\n\u2022 Stop playing immediately if you experience dizziness, nausea, eye strain, or other discomfort.\n\n[Community Content Usage]\n\u2022 Community content is accessed via the BeatSaver(beatsaver.com) API.\n\u2022 At first launch, users are prompted to accept BeatSaver's Terms and Policies.", "short_description": "Swing to the beat!\nForever FREE to play.\nEndless community maps."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://beatbat.io/#/en/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Beat Bat Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://beatbat.io/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1672577396871977"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26196970159907710"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499617831_1415992693212522_755785755843997449_n.pn